note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note goal2en driver: stdin one G line, stdout one English review sentence
note (exit 0) or `G2E_INVALID goal <reason>` (exit 31). Exit 2: usage (any
note argument) or a stdin read/stdout write error.
fn main to int
if ne argcnt 1
otpfr 10
otflush
ret 2
end
k = otrdin
if eq k neg long 2
ret 2
end
n = ulong 1024
if ge k 0
n = ulong k
end
code = otgoalen n
otflush
ret code
end
